msgstr "Mnogo transakcija na računu '%1' nije usklađeno"

#: plugins/skrooge/skrooge_operation/skgoperationplugin.cpp:1302
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Advice on making the best (long)"
msgid ""
"Do not forget to reconcile your accounts. By doing so, you acknowledge that "
"your bank has indeed processed these transactions on your account. This is "
"how you enforce compliance with your bank's statements. See online help for "
"more details"
msgstr "Ne zaboravite uskladiti račune. Time potvrđujete da je banka zaista obradila te transakcije na vašem računu i provjeravate njihovu podudarnost s bankovnim izvodima. Dodatne pojedinosti potražite u mrežnoj pomoći."

#: plugins/skrooge/skrooge_operation/skgoperationplugin.cpp:1307
